<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan converts 8.7 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan converts 8.7 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc said Monday it had converted about 8.65 million Depositary Shares into about 8.83 million shares after making a redemption call.</p>
<p>It said it would redeem the remaining Depositary Shares for about $2.5 million cash.</p>
<p>There were about 8.75 million Depositary Shares outstanding at the time of the call, it added.</p>
<p>The company said it converted the shares at a rate of about 1.0208 FCX Class A common shares per Depositary Share.</p>
<p>Prior to the conversion, FCX Class A and Class B common shares and common share equivalents outstanding as of September 30 totaled about 195 million shares, it said.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in mineral exploration and development.</p>
</text>
